
                   ###########################################
                   Other Components Needed to Build Tinker-FFE                 
                   ###########################################

      This directory contains additional pieces needed for building Force
      Field Explorer (FFE). Ant is needed for running the main FFE build
      scripts. Groovy is used to implement and compile the FFE Shell. J3D
      is the Java 3D API used by the FFE graphics engine.

      The Java directory contains JDKs to be installed on build machines
      as well as JREs to be bundled with FFE on Linux, macOS and Windows
      platforms. Mesa is an OpenGL emulation library for systems without
      hardware OpenGL support. Sun JCE has a jar file with code to enable
      2048-bit DH keypairs.

